--- text
Your subscription is cancelled

Your [PLAN_NAME] subscription to [PRODUCT_NAME] is cancelled. There
will be no more charges.

[PRODUCT_NAME] keeps working until [GRACE_END_DATE]. After that
date the paid features stop and the account stays open with no
plan.

Details of the cancellation

Plan: [PLAN_NAME]
Cancelled on: [EVENT_TIME]
Access until: [GRACE_END_DATE]
Final charge: [CURRENCY] [AMOUNT] on [INVOICE_DATE]

Your data is kept for [RETENTION_PERIOD] after [GRACE_END_DATE],
until [RETENTION_END_DATE]. Nothing is deleted before then. If you
reactivate before that date, your account comes back with the same
data. After that date the data is deleted and cannot be recovered.

To start the subscription again, use the link below. The plan and
the price in effect at that time apply.

Reactivate your subscription:

[SECONDARY_URL]

If this is not what you expected, reply to this email, or write to
[SUPPORT_EMAIL]. A real person reads every message.

[SIGNOFF_NAME], [COMPANY_NAME]
